.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH archived 1  "archived " 
.SH NAME
archived \- List archived items (any status). Ordered by archive\-date descending (most recent first); override with `\-\-sort`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBarchived\fR [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List archived items (any status). Ordered by archive\-date descending (most recent first); override with `\-\-sort`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR
Sort order: `archived` | `id` | `rank` (default `archived`). An unknown key is a loud error
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
